OL,3,GNEWSABulger killer's parole hearing to
OL,4,Abe held in private
OL,5,
OL,6,FChild killer Jon Venables will have his
OL,7,Flatest parole bid heard in private
OL,8,Fdespite a plea from his victim's mother
OL,9,Ffor it to be public, the Parole Board
OL,10,Fhas decided.
OL,12,FVenables tortured and murdered
OL,13,Ftwo-year-old James Bulger in 1993.
OL,15,FThe 44-year-old will have his case
OL,16,Fheard by parole chiefs at an oral
OL,17,Fhearing more than two years after his
OL,18,Flast appeal.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
